## How Long Do Champagne NYE Nails Last?

Champagne chrome nails last two to three weeks with a proper gel application, comfortably past New Year's Day brunch and into the first weeks of January. Regular polish versions hold closer to five to seven days before chipping starts to show.

The chrome finish itself does not fade the way glitter or a bold pigment might. What determines longevity is prep, and specifically how well the natural oil was removed from the nail bed before the base coat went on.

